commit 5ff6996156ae0390003407b12e24302cd145b2a8
Author: Digital1232 <digitalmarketing@vilpower.com>
Date:   Thu Jun 25 16:21:36 2026 +0530

    Fix: Strategy Calendar status colors and repair encoding corruption
    
    1. Restored original Unicode characters (emojis, lines, punctuation) across index.html that were corrupted due to a mismatch in file encoding during previous edits.
    2. Updated getStrategyStatusColor and getStrategyClientColor to support pill mode formatting with Tailwind CSS theme classes (dark:).
    3. Configured calendar grid day event cards to render as status-based pills, displaying colored text on light backgrounds in light mode, and light text on dark backgrounds in dark mode.

